<title>JAPAN: NHK Precision - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>NHK Precision - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  4.27		vs	    4.08</p>
<p> Operating	  162    million	  vs	  145    million</p>
<p> Current	    169    million	  vs	  152    million</p>
<p> Net		   61    million	  vs	   72    million</p>
<p> EPS		    5.73 yen	  vs	    6.70 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     11 million	  vs	  11 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.50 yen	  vs	    3.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - NHK Precision Co Ltd is a major maker of tools for screws, special sprongs, and brake disks for motorcycles.</p>
</text>
